   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 1.3.2 Total Outdoor Space\n",
    "\n",
    "Outdoor space can matter a lot for price. We create:\n",
    "\n",
    "```total_outdoor = lot-area + garden-size```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 537,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def add_total_outdoor(data):\n",
    "    data = data.copy()\n",
    "    data[\"total_outdoor\"] = data[\"lot-area\"] + data[\"garden-size\"]\n",
    "    return data"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 538,
